--- /dev/null
+++ b/android/screenshots/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+# Material 3 screenshots
+
+Rendered PNGs of the app's real Compose screens, produced headlessly with
+Robolectric + Compose UI test (there is no emulator on this machine).
+
+Each image is 822 x 1782 px: the 411 x 891 dp Pixel-class phone layout at
+xhdpi. They are captured from `BaiduNetGoApp` (large top app bar + bottom
+`NavigationBar` + screen) and `SignInScreen` exactly as `MainActivity` shows
+them; only the state is sample data (`AppUiState` built in the test, modelled on
+`AppUiSamples` but with folders, albums, a running backup, last results and
+transfer history).
+
+| File | Screen | Theme | Notes |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `signin-light.png` | 登录 | light | QR placeholder, cookie-login button |
+| `signin-dark.png` | 登录 | dark | |
+| `backup-light.png` | 备份 | light | top of the list |
+| `backup-dark.png` | 备份 | dark | |
+| `backup-running-light.png` | 备份 | light | scrolled: run card, last result, actions |
+| `gallery-light.png` | 相册备份 | light | switches + first album row |
+| `gallery-dark.png` | 相册备份 | dark | |
+| `gallery-albums-light.png` | 相册备份 | light | scrolled: album grid, run card, result |
+| `transfer-light.png` | 传输 | light | running uploads + history |
+| `transfer-dark.png` | 传输 | dark | |
+| `settings-light.png` | 设置 | light | account card, backup options |
+| `settings-dark.png` | 设置 | dark | |
+| `settings-about-light.png` | 设置 | light | scrolled: appearance, about |
+
+Caveats of the harness (not of the app):
+
+- The brand color scheme is used (`BaiduNetGoTheme(dynamicColor = false)`); on
+  Android 12+ the real app may use the wallpaper-derived scheme.
+- Robolectric draws no system UI, so the status bar and navigation gesture bar
+  are absent and insets are zero.
+- Album covers are `null` in the sample state (no MediaStore in a JVM test), so
+  album tiles show the placeholder icon instead of thumbnails.
+- Each screenshot is taken from a fresh composition; reusing one activity for
+  several captures left the navigation bar's deselected items with a half-faded
+  selection pill (a Robolectric animation-clock artifact, not a UI bug).
+
+Regenerate with:
+
+```bash
+cd android
+./gradlew :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests 'com.pengstem.baidunetgo.ui.ScreenshotTest'
+```
+
+The test is `android/app/src/test/java/com/pengstem/baidunetgo/ui/ScreenshotTest.kt`;
+it writes into this directory via the `screenshot.dir` system property set in
+`android/app/build.gradle.kts`.
\ No newline at end of file
